 ne at JUST FOR LAUGHS\, the largest comedy festival in the world\, hosted i
 n Montreal\, Canada. Among his many credits\, Rafi has three comedy special
 s on Netflix:\, A Arte do Insulto\, Péssima Influencia\, and Ultimato. He
